flowchart TD

A[Producer Service<br/>Monitoring / API / Device] -->|Publish Event| B[EventBridge]

B --> C[Consumer Lambda]

C --> D[Middleware Pipeline]

D --> D1[Context Middleware]
D --> D2[Invocation Context]
D --> D3[Logger Middleware]
D --> D4[Tracer Middleware]
D --> D5[Schema Validation]
D --> D6[Performance Middleware]
D --> D7[Error Middleware]

D7 --> E[Business Handler]

E --> F[Domain Logic<br/>Alert Creation / Processing]

F --> G[(DynamoDB / Storage)]

F --> H[Publish New Events<br/>AlertCreated, etc.]

H --> B

E --> I[Response / Ack]